      "ai": {
        "model": "bai/qwen3.8-flash",
        "v": 5,
        "title": "Replace file-picker-max with file-picker using Grok 4 Fast",
        "summary": "The internal file-picker-max agent was deleted and its references replaced by the standard file-picker agent. The file-picker model switched from google/gemini-2.5-flash to google/gemini-2.0-flash-001 with low-effort reasoning disabled, while the file-lister helper agent updated its model to x-ai/grok-4-fast and increased maxTokens to 500_000. This change affects the base2 orchestrator agents, task-researcher variants, and file-explorer subsystems in the .agents directory.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "at": "2026-09-15T05:44:50.751Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "When you ask the agent to find relevant files in a codebase, it now uses a single, faster built-in file-finder instead of the old specialized one that was deleted. That finder has also switched to a quicker AI model (Grok 4 Fast), so it should locate files more rapidly while reading up to 500,000 tokens of content. This affects the main task-planning agents and research helpers in the.agents directory, so you'll notice the file-search step in your plan or implementation runs a bit differently and completes faster. The change is live today; the deleted agent is gone, and all references point to the new one.",
        "model": "vyce/deepseek-v4.1",
        "v": 4,
